    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your land from waves of invading mice!</strong><br>Play solo or with up to 4 players in this fast-paced action roguelike where heroic animals fight to protect their homeland. Choose from a variety of upgrades, level up your abilities, and face off against endless waves of enemies and powerful bosses. Whether you\u2019re jumping in for a quick run or grinding to unlock permanent upgrades, each session brings new chaos and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up and hard to put down, this game is all about quick action, teamwork, and constant progression. The more you play, the stronger you get!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your land from waves of invading mice!</strong><br>Play solo or with up to 4 players in this fast-paced action roguelike where heroic animals fight to protect their homeland. Choose from a variety of upgrades, level up your abilities, and face off against endless waves of enemies and powerful bosses. Whether you\u2019re jumping in for a quick run or grinding to unlock permanent upgrades, each session brings new chaos and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up and hard to put down, this game is all about quick action, teamwork, and constant progression. The more you play, the stronger you get!</p>",
